                                "sense_id": "e8ad469c-c7be-3d5d-8bae-b80d9e1d43f4",
                                "text": "We had a Volkswagen campervan – the greatest vehicles ever created; a cheerp cupboard on wheels – and when my parents had finished noisily co-joining, they would take us on post-coital journey all across West Wales […]."
